          </zone>
          <zone h='14951' id='47' is-fixed='true' type-v2='layout-basic' w='98218' x='891' y='83618'>
            <zone h='14951' id='48' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98218' x='891' y='83618'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14951' id='46' type-v2='text' w='98218' x='891' y='83618'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2b5c8f' fontsize='11'>Key Recommendations</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'>1. </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Targeted Summer Weekend Campaigns:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'> Deploy geofenced digital ads &amp; on-site promotions at top casual hotspots (Navy Pier, DuSable Lake Shore Dr) during peak summer weekends (May–Aug) highlighting annual membership savings. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'>2.</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'> Flexible / Seasonal Membership Tiers:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'> Introduce a &quot;Summer Pass&quot; or &quot;Weekend Pass&quot; tailored for leisure riders, featuring an automated discount path to convert into full Annual Memberships. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'>3. </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>E-Bike Loyalty Incentives:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333'> Capitalize on high casual e-bike preference (72.5%) by offering members waived e-bike unlock fees and discounted per-minute rates.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#707070' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Footnote: Data sourced from Divvy Bike-Share System Data (July 2025 – June 2026). Processed via Python (Pandas/Scikit-Learn) &amp; Visualized in Tableau.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='10' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#f0f4f8' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
